# Fixture layers are whole synthetic projects, so they hold files the root
# .gitignore drops (data/ folders, .env files, logs, editor folders). Track
# every file here: a fixture builds only from exactly the files that were
# reviewed. Files a layer's own .gitignore hides (scoper-14's node_modules/)
# need `git add -f`; `pnpm evals check` lists any that git would leave out.
!*
!*/
# Except what stays local: each spec dir's generation log, the decision logs,
# and the .DS_Store files Finder writes.
/*/*/gen/
/decisions.jsonl
/regenerate-notes.json
.DS_Store
